  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Life; <strong>Caster Level</strong> 2nd<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> Feet; <strong>Price</strong> 4,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> —<br>\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\nThese sturdy leather boots are prized by mercenaries who can’t afford the services of a healer. When standing upright on solid soil or stone, slamming the heel of either boot into the ground (a free action) will grant the wearer fast healing 1 for 2 minutes. Each boot can be used once per day, and can be used at the same time or separately (the effect stacks with itself). Both boots must be worn for the magic to be effective. The boots also grant DR 5/magic versus anything harmful that the wearer steps on that are environmental in nature, or traps that attack from beneath the wearer.<br>\n<strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Wondrous Item, Life sphere, Revitalize; Cost 2,000 gp</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/marvelous-items-2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
